{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42587","headline":"赠天台逸人 · 廖融","name":"赠天台逸人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移桧托禅子，携家上赤城。\n拂琴天籁寂，欹枕海涛生。\n云白寒峰晚，鸟歌春谷晴。\n又闻求桂檝，载月十洲行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}